 qemu-server (9.2.19) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * fix #5032: agent: add the 'sync-time-on-resume' option to set the guest
     clock to the host time through the guest agent after operations that
     leave it behind: resuming from hibernation or pause, rolling back to a
     snapshot with RAM, live migration, taking a snapshot, and backups in
     suspend mode. The option is off by default. The start, resume and rollback
     API endpoints get a 'sync-time-on-resume' parameter to override it for a
     single operation.
 
